{"id":"memorial_103904","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial103900","label":"Call Logs · Deep within the Crystal Region"},"label":"011.smi","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_103903","next":null,"speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_103904_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_04_description","text":"(Original file damaged. Only subtitles remain.)"},{"id":"memorial_103904_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_04_description","text":"There's something inside the innermost crystal."},{"id":"memorial_103904_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_04_description","text":"It seems to be the raw material that constitutes the glass shields."},{"id":"memorial_103904_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_04_description","text":"This space must be some kind of display room for these shields."},{"id":"memorial_103904_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_04_description","text":"Otherwise, it doesn't make any sense to have so many replicas in one place."},{"id":"memorial_103904_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_04_description","text":"Hm..."},{"id":"memorial_103904_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_04_description","text":"It feels a bit odd to say this right now, but..."},{"id":"memorial_103904_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_04_description","text":"... They're incredibly beautiful."},{"id":"memorial_103904_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_04_description","text":"What are they made of..."},{"id":"memorial_103904_10","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_04_description","text":"(Sound of collision.)"},{"id":"memorial_103904_11","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_04_description","text":"(Sound of falling to the ground.)"},{"id":"memorial_103904_12","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_04_description","text":"(Sound of dragging on the floor.)"}]}